354893_2123985974762689_1544591742969265917_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WstIXqg3PkAQ7kNvwGH-L4a&_nc_oc=Adrrv5iUJ2TQpfiTX-ylA9WiF9KDUjxbFOxmCYingnnVa7OlMO8Eg_7gS0GBrUVCLJ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS8pgR0M1PJS6mmtJIi_JpoeJuA_AZDJnIySLxn2bF4oQ&oe=6B0DB063"}, {"file_name": "image4.png", "id": "1479678613042418", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300750_1479678616375751_6997581480530838541_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sAFA03eVLgIQ7kNvwEe568j&_nc_oc=AdqR5l7uSGyloJV04BtulFpy6XjvVtCyKjqgJ52AccMGHm18W056w5ate5M0dfEPXGc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSkSGEGigH3M9efTV_U0tm1xT4ausDlKS7E_VmXr9e2CA&oe=6B0DAF70"}, {"file_name": "image5.png", "id": "1245528793651676", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499349371_1245528796985009_3447873084062975841_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=baUig8_McRIQ7kNvwFXq4ns&_nc_oc=AdoUyEa9vJ6VlDpXObr4MQhLwEwkCGRfi6CbdLbN5ygnWFTmY1VNoFK7NcXEowwQ9z8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQiwVYxLwtEw7qhq0tyjF2Qpimee9IXc1ZabgVGii0r4w&oe=6B0DAE2D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hero360", "keywords": [], "long_description": "HERO 360 is a virtual reality training tool designed to teach people how to evacuate a house safely during a fire\u2014whether or not a smoke alarm is present. The name \u201cHERO\u201d reflects the purpose of the app: to empower users to become their own hero by learning life-saving reflexes and making the right decisions in a high-risk situation. Surviving a fire starts with knowledge and preparation\u2014HERO 360 gives users the chance to practice that before it\u2019s real.", "short_description": "HERO 360 is a virtual reality training tool designed to teach people how to evacuate a house safely dur